    "ls|LS17_S7_U_158": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF RAILWAYS \n \nLOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO.158 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 08.12.2021 \n \nCONSTRUCTION OF RUB/ROB IN MISRIKH \n \n†*158. SHRI ASHOK KUMAR RAWAT: \nWill the Minister of RAILWAYS be pleased to state: \n(a) the details of the railway crossings between Mandhana and \nMakanpur and railway stations along the National Highway under \nMisrikh Parliamentary Constituency of Uttar Pradesh; \n(b) whether the Government has taken or proposes to take any steps \nor conducted a surv ey to construct an underpass at the railway \ncrossing between Mandhana and Makanpur and Over Bridge at \ncrossings of railway stations along the National Highway under Misrikh \nParliamentary Constituency of Uttar Pradesh; \n(c) if so, the details thereof; \n(d) whether th e Government has received requests from the public \nrepresentatives in October, 2021 in this regard; and \n(e) if so, the details thereof and the progress made so far in this \nregard? \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF RAILWAYS, COMMUNICATIONS AND \nELECTRONICS & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \n \n(SHRI ASHWINI VAISHNAW) \n(a) to (e): A Statement is laid on the Table of the House. \n*****  \n\nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (a) TO (e) OF \nSTARRED QUESTION NO.158 BY SHRI  ASHOK KUMAR RAWAT TO  BE \nANSWERED IN LOK SABHA ON 08.12.2021 REGAR DING \nCONSTRUCTION OF RUB/ROB IN MISRIKH \n \n(a) to (c): There are total 40 Nos. manned level crossings between \nMandhana and Araul Makanpur railway station along National Highway \n(NH) on Kanpur Anwarganj -Farukhabad section under Misrikh \nparliamentary constitue ncy.  Survey for construction of underpass & \noverbridges at these Level Crossings (LCs) between Mandhana and \nAraul Makanpur railway station has been done. Details of LCs & \nfeasibility status of Road Over Bridge/Road Under Bridge (ROB/RUB) in \nlieu of these level crossings is appended.  \n(d): No, Sir. \n(e): Does not arise. \n***** \n  \n\nAPPENDIX REFERRED TO 