    "ls|LS17_S7_U_25": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF HOME AFFAIRS \n \nLOK SABHA \nSTARRED QUESTION NO. *25 \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON THE 30TH NOVEMBER, 2021/ AGRAHAYANA 9, 1943 (SAKA) \n \nNIRBHAYA FUND \n \n*25.      SHRI MOHAMMED FAIZAL P.P.: \n \nWill the Minister of HOME AFFAIRS be pleased to state:  \n \n(a) the quantum of Nirbhaya Funds allocated and  utilised since 2014, State-wise; \nand \n \n(b) the quantum of Nirbhaya Funds allocated and  utilised to implement the Safe \nCity Component of the Nirbhaya Scheme, city-wise, since 2014? \n \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF HOME AFFAIRS \n(SHRI AJAY KUMAR MISHRA) \n \n \n(a) and (b): A statement is laid on the table of the house. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n-2- \n \nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO IN THE REPLY TO THE STARRED QUESTION NO. *25 \nFOR REPLY ON 30 NOVEMBER 2021 \n(a): The Ministry of Home Affairs (MHA) is implementing several projects for \nsafety of women under the Nirbhaya Fund scheme through the States/Union \nTerritories. Total fund allocation approved and released to States/Union \nTerritories, year-wise, by MHA under Nirbhaya Funds scheme is at Annexure I. \n(b): The details of fund allocation approved and released to States/UTs for Safe \nCity projects in the last five years city-wise is separately given at Annexure II. \n  \n\nAnnexure I referred to in reply to Lok Sabha starred Question No 25 for answer on 30 \nNovember 2021 on State -wise year wise funds approved and released to States/Union \nTerritories in projects being implemented by MHA using Nirbhaya Fund  \n(in Rs. crore) \nS no States/ UTs Total \nfunds \napproved  \nFunds released  \n2016-\n2017 \n2017-\n2018 \n2018-\n2019 \n2019-\n2020 \n2020-21 \n1 Andhra Pradesh 29.46 16.43 4.43 0.00 8.60 0.00 \n2 Arunachal \nPradesh \n11.98 5.72 1.65 0.00 4.61 0.00 \n3 Assam 27.57 16.54 4.19 0.00 6.84 0.00 \n4 Bihar 33.18 19.52 2.47 0.00 11.19 0.12 \n5 Chhattisgarh 23.91 14.28 2.59 0.00 7.04 0.00 \n